{"unit_id":"alingalingling__ui-status-label#card-zh","repo":"alingalingling/ui-status-label","commit":"a1621413a4700cb489655ad3ebf7fa8484c3645f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-ui-status-label**（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH Web 聊天视图自定义智能体运行期间显示的状态文案。它在 General 设置区注册文本输入行，将用户修改写入 `ui-status-label` 持久化设置，并通过 `conversationStatus` 服务向聊天视图提供当前文案；对尚未读取该服务的版本，还会用 DOM 观察器替换默认状态文本。用户可输入最多 40 个字符，清空后恢复默认文案。适合希望把运行提示改成自定义语句的 DSH Web 用户。设置行提供中英文界面，不需要额外 API key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:46-71","src/client/StatusLabelRow.tsx:6-7","src/client/status-label-policy.ts:44-57","src/client/status-label-injector.ts:24-50"]}
{"unit_id":"alingalingling__ui-status-label#card-en","repo":"alingalingling/ui-status-label","commit":"a1621413a4700cb489655ad3ebf7fa8484c3645f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-ui-status-label** customizes DSH Web’s running status text. A General settings input saves the label and supplies it through `conversationStatus`; a DOM observer supports older chat views. The 40-character field restores its default when cleared.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:46-71","src/client/StatusLabelRow.tsx:6-7","src/client/status-label-policy.ts:44-57","src/client/status-label-injector.ts:24-50"]}
