{"unit_id":"alingalingling__ui-status-label#caveat-1","repo":"alingalingling/ui-status-label","commit":"a1621413a4700cb489655ad3ebf7fa8484c3645f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-status-label 的旧版界面兜底只匹配 `[role=\"status\"]` 中的 `Deep diving...` 文本；上游界面改变标记或默认文案时，这条 DOM 替换路径可能不再命中。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/status-label-injector.ts:12-16","src/client/status-label-injector.ts:29-37"]}
